    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;adjust log directory so one can run :log rikai on neovim nightly

formatting

bumped flake

ci: add a ci devShell that incorporates neovim

just for debug

use busted instead of lx

doc: mention lx lua in contributing

bumped flake

squash

introducing RIKAI_DICTIONARIES_FOLDER 

fixed utils_spec

fixed tokenizer

cleanup

fix tests

feat(justfile): added &amp;#39;lint&amp;#39; command

alias to treefmt, maybe &amp;#39;lx lint&amp;#39; later

fixes

notifications from alogger  generate errors with busted on teardown

so we disable it when busted is loaded. It really is annoying so I am
looking forward removal of alogger&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
